  "document": "It's in the Air\nIt ’s in the Air is a 1938 British comedy film written and directed by Anthony Kimmins and starring George Formby, Polly Ward and Jack Hobbs. The film was released in the United States with the alternative title George Takes the Air in 1940. Although released in pre-war times, no mention of the imminent hostilities is in\" It's in the Air\"."
